                                <p className="text-gray-500 font-medium mt-0.5">Find <span className="font-bold text-blue-600 font-mono">"{exportSuccessGuide.filename}"</span> inside your Windows <span className="font-bold text-gray-900">Downloads</span> folder.</p>
